{"3482370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Our Dreadling", "steam_appid": 3482370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Surreal Journey in Our <i>Dreadling</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of our little pink dreadling on its mission to uncover the enigmatic Monono.  <i>Our</i> <i>Dreadling</i> is a minimalist platformer with Metroidvania-style exploration, delivering a  blend of dark humor, introspective storytelling, and surreal environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Preperation for Playing Our Dreadling Please Ask Yourself the Following:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like Jellybeans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you pet the dog?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want a worm that follows you around?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like being stuck in the middle of an eternal conflict between mysterious forces?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do minigames get you going?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you take naps with strangers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you disco?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cake or Pie?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.poster.avif?t=1782326774\" width=1600 height=946 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.webm?t=1782326774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/665c8173409dcd6e6e60cc1da9d657b6.mp4?t=1782326774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Liminal:</strong> Delve deep into the bizarre world of the Liminal as you seek Monono.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uhhh... Strange Storytelling:</strong> Experience a narrative that invites players to piece together its hidden layers through dialogue and  visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-Games:</strong> Break up your journey with a variety of quirky  mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> A blend of unique story telling and tongue-in-cheek dialogue that keeps you entertained... or doesn't...  if you're a SQUARE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist:</strong> Inspired by titles like <i>Undertale </i>and<i> Buddy Simulator 1984</i>, <i>Our</i> <i>Dreadling</i> combines simplicity, charm and a whole lot of love to bring a surreal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist <i>Our Dreadling</i> Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our little pink Dreadling in this unforgettable journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow today to stay updated!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/62b3c7f6886ad591e4d8baac511bebda.poster.avif?t=1782326774\" width=324 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/62b3c7f6886ad591e4d8baac511bebda.webm?t=1782326774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482370/extras/62b3c7f6886ad591e4d8baac511bebda.mp4?t=1782326774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a Surreal Journey in Our <i>Dreadling</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of our little pink dreadling on its mission to unco